      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "pet_behavior_comedy",
      "label": "Pet behavior comedy",
      "description": "The meme is part of a broader genre of internet humor that revolves around pet behavior, particularly cats. This genre often involves exaggerating or anthropomorphizing pet behavior for comedic effect. The humor in this meme is derived from the absurdity of the situation and the cat's smug expression, which are common tropes in pet behavior comedy. This genre is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's intent.",
