      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
      "label": "User projected onto the text as the recipient of the cat's response",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'ah, quit your screaming', which is directed at the user. The text implies the user is the one 'screaming' or complaining, and the cat is responding to them. The user identifies with the role of the person being addressed by the cat, creating a direct interaction where the user is the target of the cat's 'defiant' statement.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
